1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,350
Left behind, left in the dust,

2
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,600
now lose every place you could turn to.

3
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,500
Rather than putting on a fake smile,

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,800
sometimes it's better to be alone.

5
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:33,500
Things so awful they drag you down?

6
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,200
Quit. Someone else can take your place.

7
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,700
If you throw it all away and give up,

8
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:44,600
no one's going to stand in your way.

9
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:51,100
I don't want to leave this half done.

10
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,200
Even when you're betrayed and hurt,

11
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:58,400
you can grow stronger. Change your heart.

12
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:02,250
I've come this far. I can't stop.

13
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:06,000
I can't stand losing. No way out.

14
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
At a crossroads, on the way back,

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,950
I look back, but the night rain hides it all.

16
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:16,800
Something's missing. I can't stop.

17
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:20,800
With all this doubt, there's no way out.

18
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:25,050
I have to press on until the answer appears.

19
00:01:25,050 --> 00:01:27,500
Never, never mind.
